<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-PAST WINNERS OF GOLDEN BALL AWARD.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-PAST WINNERS OF GOLDEN BALL AWARD.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are the winners of the Golden Ball award for the European soccer player of the year:</p>
<p>1956 - Stanley Matthews (Blackpool)</p>
<p>1957 - Alfredo di Stefano (Real Madrid)</p>
<p>1958 - Raymond Kopa (Real Madrid)</p>
<p>1959 - Di Stefano</p>
<p>1960 - Luis Suarez (Barcelona)</p>
<p>1961 - Omar Sivori (Juventus)</p>
<p>1962 - Josef Masopust (Dukla Prague)</p>
<p>1963 - Lev Yashin (Dynamo Moscow)</p>
<p>1964 - Denis Law (Manchester United)</p>
<p>1965 - Eusebio (Benfica)</p>
<p>1966 - Bobby Charlton (Manchester United)</p>
<p>1967 - Florian Albert (Ferencvaros)</p>
<p>1968 - George Best (Manchester United)</p>
<p>1969 - Gianni Rivera (AC Milan)</p>
<p>1970 - Gert Mueller (Bayern Munich)</p>
<p>1971 - Johan Cryuff (Ajax Amsterdam)</p>
<p>1972 - Franz Beckenbauer (Bayern Munich)</p>
<p>1973 - Cruyff (Barcelona)</p>
<p>1974 - Cryuff (Barcelona)</p>
<p>1975 - Oleg Blokhin (Dynamo Kiev)</p>
<p>1976 - Beckenbauer (Bayern Munich)</p>
<p>1977 - Allan Simonsen (Borussia Moenchengladbach)</p>
<p>1978 - Kevin Keegan (Hamburg)</p>
<p>1979 - Keegan (Hamburg)</p>
<p>1980 - Karlheinz Rummenigge (Bayern Munich)</p>
<p>1981 - Rummenigge (Bayern Munich)</p>
<p>1982 - Paolo Rossi (Juventus)</p>
<p>1983 - Michel Platini (Juventus)</p>
<p>1984 - Platini (Juventus)</p>
<p>1985 - Platini (Juventus)</p>
<p>1986 - Igor Belanov (Dynamo Kiev)</p>
<p>1987 - Ruud Gullit (AC Milan)</p>
<p>1988 - Marco van Basten (AC Milan)</p>
<p>1989 - Van Basten (AC Milan)</p>
<p>1990 - Lothar Matthaeus (Internazionale)</p>
<p>1991 - Jean-Pierre Papin (Marseille)</p>
<p>1992 - Van Basten (AC Milan)</p>
<p>1993 - Roberto Baggio (Juventus)</p>
<p>1994 - Hristo Stoichkov (Barcelona)</p>
<p>1995 - George Weah (AC Milan)</p>
<p>1996 - Matthias Sammer (Borussia Dortmund)</p>
